{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36981","headline":"送汝州李中丞十二韵 · 罗隐","name":"送汝州李中丞十二韵","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"羣盗方爲梗，分符奏未宁。\n黄巾攻郡邑，白梃掠生灵。\n尘土周畿暗，疮痍汝水腥。\n一凶虽剪灭，数县尚凋零。\n理必资宽猛，谋须藉典刑。\n与能才物论，慎选忽天庭。\n官品尊台秩，山河拥福星。\n虎知应去境，牛在肯全形。\n旧政穷人瘼，新衔展武经。\n关防秋草白，城壁晚峰青。\n破胆期来复，迷魂想待醒。\n鲁山行县後，聊爲奠惟馨。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"罗隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36981.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36981","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}